WEBVTT

01:35.830 --> 01:40.860
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.630 --> 01:44.020
[Episode 9]

02:06.760 --> 02:09.190
Miss Yixiao went to see Xia Jingshi?

02:09.470 --> 02:11.000
Then the two of them are

02:11.240 --> 02:12.500
old friends reunited.

02:13.030 --> 02:15.240
They must be hugging and crying

02:15.630 --> 02:17.960
as they pour out their feelings right now.

02:19.630 --> 02:21.230
Do you want to go check on her?

02:21.870 --> 02:23.730
Well, that won't be necessary...

02:23.910 --> 02:24.640
No, I mean...

02:25.120 --> 02:25.630
No need.

02:27.400 --> 02:29.600
There's really no need, Your Highness.

02:31.710 --> 02:32.510
It's alright.

02:33.030 --> 02:34.829
It's okay if you don't remember.

02:35.030 --> 02:36.630
We have plenty of time ahead.

02:37.000 --> 02:37.560
I'll make sure

02:37.560 --> 02:39.020
you stand by my side again.

02:39.840 --> 02:41.030
Stand by your side?

02:41.710 --> 02:43.770
Even if you don't remember anything,

02:44.120 --> 02:45.380
I still want you to know

02:46.610 --> 02:49.470
you're the only one
my heart belongs to in this life.

02:49.840 --> 02:51.560
We once vowed before the heavens

02:51.560 --> 02:53.160
to spend our lives together.

02:54.280 --> 02:54.800
Yixiao.

02:55.190 --> 02:56.240
Losing you was

02:56.240 --> 02:58.040
my greatest regret in this life,

02:58.190 --> 02:59.050
but finding you

02:59.750 --> 03:00.750
is

03:01.030 --> 03:02.230
my greatest fortune.

03:05.360 --> 03:05.870
Yixiao.

03:16.470 --> 03:17.200
I understand

03:18.840 --> 03:20.590
that you don't remember anything.

03:20.590 --> 03:21.870
To you,

03:21.870 --> 03:23.200
I'm just a stranger now.

03:23.870 --> 03:25.870
It's normal for you to feel distant.

03:27.190 --> 03:27.790
I'm sorry.

03:29.560 --> 03:30.750
But to me,

03:31.840 --> 03:34.000
you're not just a female general
under my command,

03:34.000 --> 03:35.520
but also the one closest to me,

03:35.520 --> 03:36.650
the one I trust most.

03:37.630 --> 03:38.829
The one closest to you

03:39.280 --> 03:40.340
and you trust most?

03:41.120 --> 03:43.030
I remember Your Highness once said to me

03:43.030 --> 03:44.400
that after the Battle of Pingling,

03:44.400 --> 03:45.470
you'd marry me.

03:49.400 --> 03:50.710
You don't need to worry.

03:50.710 --> 03:52.710
I'm not here to force you into marriage.

03:52.710 --> 03:53.870
I just wanted to confirm

03:53.870 --> 03:55.270
if that really happened.

03:55.400 --> 03:57.680
After all, marriage is no trivial matter.

03:57.680 --> 03:59.480
In the past that I've forgotten,

03:59.640 --> 04:00.680
what kind of person

04:00.680 --> 04:02.540
were you exactly, Your Highness?

04:05.000 --> 04:05.470
Yes,

04:06.590 --> 04:08.120
I did speak of marrying you.

04:10.910 --> 04:11.640
No wonder.

04:12.680 --> 04:14.080
So there really was

04:14.720 --> 04:16.180
an engagement between us.

04:17.269 --> 04:18.000
It's just...

04:20.829 --> 04:22.630
It's just about our engagement,

04:23.510 --> 04:25.440
I'm afraid I must break my promise.

04:25.480 --> 04:26.190
Our Emperor has decreed

04:26.190 --> 04:28.190
that I come to Susha
for a marriage alliance

04:28.190 --> 04:29.890
and wed Princess Xiyang.

04:30.310 --> 04:32.170
I cannot defy the imperial order.

04:32.830 --> 04:34.120
I'm not afraid to die myself,

04:34.120 --> 04:34.680
but my men who have followed me

04:34.680 --> 04:35.810
for so many years...

04:36.000 --> 04:37.650
You don't have to explain so much,
Your Highness,

04:37.650 --> 04:39.040
and you don't need to worry.

04:39.040 --> 04:39.950
To me,

04:40.200 --> 04:41.730
you're just a stranger now.

04:42.190 --> 04:43.520
This marriage alliance

04:43.630 --> 04:45.830
will bring peace back to both kingdoms,

04:46.190 --> 04:47.520
and that's a good thing.

04:49.950 --> 04:51.120
Do you really think so?

04:51.120 --> 04:51.720
Of course.

04:52.190 --> 04:54.000
I don't remember anything anyway.

04:54.000 --> 04:55.000
What's in the past

04:55.040 --> 04:55.840
is in the past.

05:02.120 --> 05:03.070
I came here today

05:03.750 --> 05:04.910
only hoping Your Highness

05:04.910 --> 05:06.450
could tell me about my past,

05:06.830 --> 05:08.430
about how I became a general,

05:09.160 --> 05:10.490
about my martial skills

05:11.310 --> 05:12.170
and my archery.

05:21.040 --> 05:22.950
Ever since I learned about
your memory loss,

05:22.950 --> 05:23.510
I've been recording

05:23.510 --> 05:24.510
every detail of your past

05:24.510 --> 05:25.500
in here.

05:25.870 --> 05:26.480
I knew

05:27.150 --> 05:28.610
it would be of use some day,

05:29.190 --> 05:30.040
and you'd want to know

05:30.040 --> 05:31.500
what happened in the past.

05:31.730 --> 05:32.720
I hope to help you

05:32.750 --> 05:33.610
as much as I can.

05:41.240 --> 05:41.970
Thanks a lot.

05:46.070 --> 05:47.400
That Moon-Shooting Bow

05:47.480 --> 05:48.740
had always been yours.

05:49.600 --> 05:50.530
Take it with you.

05:54.360 --> 05:54.920
No need.

05:58.390 --> 05:59.790
I'm a useless person now.

06:00.510 --> 06:02.170
There's no point in taking it.

06:11.630 --> 06:12.190
Yixiao.

06:13.800 --> 06:14.730
I've failed you,

06:14.800 --> 06:16.260
a debt I could never repay.

06:16.560 --> 06:18.160
But even if I can't marry you,

06:18.390 --> 06:20.440
I'll still protect you for a lifetime.

06:20.440 --> 06:21.570
You will always have

06:22.240 --> 06:23.390
a place in my heart.

06:24.840 --> 06:26.100
You've suffered here.

06:26.630 --> 06:28.490
Let's go back to Jinxiu together.

06:28.610 --> 06:29.940
Let's go home together,

06:30.920 --> 06:31.510
shall we?

06:53.720 --> 06:56.020
♪ The rain drifts endlessly ♪

06:56.630 --> 06:59.390
♪ The old dream burns the heart ♪

07:00.110 --> 07:02.080
♪ Dreams sink into ruin ♪

07:02.880 --> 07:06.040
♪ Missing the warmth of your palm ♪

07:06.640 --> 07:08.810
♪ Awaiting dusk ♪

07:09.560 --> 07:12.630
♪ Shadows take root in the mountain pass ♪

07:13.060 --> 07:18.810
♪ In just a moment, tears stained ♪

07:19.630 --> 07:21.480
♪ Amid the bustling sound
of wind and rain ♪

07:21.800 --> 07:25.900
♪ Who laughs at me,
heart cold as the desert ♪

07:26.300 --> 07:28.060
♪ Dreams turn through a lifetime ♪

07:28.400 --> 07:32.080
♪ Who sighs for me, enduring separations ♪

07:32.540 --> 07:34.440
♪ Love is a trial, harsh and cold ♪

07:35.040 --> 07:38.020
♪ Who crushes the lingering pain for me? ♪

07:38.630 --> 07:44.020
♪ Clouds vanish, rain ceases, seek me ♪

07:43.760 --> 07:46.000
[To the Emperor of Jinxiu]

07:46.740 --> 07:49.180
[First Prince of Susha Kingdom,
Feng Suige]

07:47.730 --> 07:50.610
♪ The world is vast and far ♪

07:49.870 --> 07:50.730
Your Highness.

07:59.830 --> 08:01.330
Yun Fang just told me that

08:01.360 --> 08:02.390
Miss Yixiao only stayed at the inn

08:02.390 --> 08:03.770
for less than an hour.

08:03.800 --> 08:05.390
Her two sworn brothers
insisted on letting her stay,

08:05.390 --> 08:06.240
but guess what?

08:06.240 --> 08:07.120
She didn't agree

08:07.120 --> 08:08.720
and insisted on coming back.

08:14.540 --> 08:17.540
She bought several jars of good wine

08:17.600 --> 08:19.320
on her way back,

08:19.390 --> 08:21.320
and she's drinking alone outside.

08:21.070 --> 08:21.470
[To the Emperor of Jinxiu]

08:21.680 --> 08:22.600
Whether she drinks or not

08:22.600 --> 08:23.860
is none of my business.

08:25.320 --> 08:27.390
[With Caution]

08:28.350 --> 08:34.669
[To the Emperor of Jinxiu]

08:29.480 --> 08:30.440
Find a fast horse

08:30.680 --> 08:31.800
and someone trustworthy,

08:31.800 --> 08:33.720
and quickly deliver this to the Yunlai Inn

08:33.720 --> 08:35.720
in Shengjing City, Jinxiu Kingdom.

08:38.919 --> 08:39.600
This is...

08:39.880 --> 08:40.679
That's right.

08:41.390 --> 08:43.480
It's my letter to the Emperor of Jinxiu.

08:43.480 --> 08:44.510
I'll give Xia Jingshi

08:44.510 --> 08:46.790
a grand wedding gift.

08:47.550 --> 08:48.280
Understood.

09:14.400 --> 09:17.430
♪ Take down the setting sun as my heart ♪

09:18.130 --> 09:21.310
♪ Fold the heavens and earth
to make my wings ♪

09:21.770 --> 09:23.300
♪ If fate shows no mercy ♪

09:23.620 --> 09:27.400
♪ Then don't blame my recklessness ♪

09:28.960 --> 09:32.360
♪ I thought this life
would drift like a solitary sail ♪

09:32.680 --> 09:35.850
♪ Yet I chanced upon you
in the smoke-filled alleyway ♪

09:36.430 --> 09:39.400
♪ Like a fleeting flower falling into ♪

09:39.910 --> 09:42.450
♪ My eyes ♪

09:41.200 --> 09:43.100
It was you who interfered, wasn't it?

09:43.100 --> 09:44.530
Such a despicable trick

09:44.560 --> 09:46.480
does seem like something you would do.

09:46.480 --> 09:47.150
Yixiao.

09:47.320 --> 09:48.750
When we heard you wanted to see us,

09:48.750 --> 09:50.380
His Highness was overjoyed.

09:50.410 --> 09:51.320
But as soon as he stepped out,

09:51.320 --> 09:52.600
he was summoned to the palace
by Empress Zhuang.

09:52.600 --> 09:53.970
So, Yixiao...

09:54.240 --> 09:54.960
We didn't expect

09:54.960 --> 09:57.220
you'd actually come to find us yourself.

10:02.670 --> 10:03.870
It's only an apology.

10:04.270 --> 10:05.510
Just a few words.

10:29.720 --> 10:31.320
Why is he so full of himself?

10:31.630 --> 10:32.420
Forget it.

10:32.910 --> 10:34.910
If he doesn't want to see me, so be it.

10:38.150 --> 10:39.500
Fu Yixiao.

10:39.750 --> 10:41.480
Showing no sincerity at all.

11:01.120 --> 11:02.610
I've opened the wine.

11:02.720 --> 11:04.780
It'll be a waste if you don't drink it.

11:08.960 --> 11:11.370
Since you're taking the initiative to
admit your mistake,

11:11.370 --> 11:12.840
I'll be generous

11:13.120 --> 11:14.240
and let it slide.

11:15.830 --> 11:17.470
But you'd better come clean—

11:17.610 --> 11:19.810
what did Xia Jingshi say to you today...

11:21.550 --> 11:24.830
♪ Take down the setting sun as my heart ♪

11:25.200 --> 11:28.590
♪ Fold the heavens and earth
to make my wings ♪

11:29.150 --> 11:30.560
♪ If fate shows no mercy ♪

11:31.050 --> 11:34.710
♪ Then don't blame my recklessness ♪

11:36.320 --> 11:39.650
♪ I thought this life
would drift like a solitary sail ♪

11:40.150 --> 11:43.230
♪ Yet I chanced upon you
in the smoke-filled alleyway ♪

11:43.580 --> 11:46.720
♪ Like a fleeting flower falling into ♪

11:46.940 --> 11:49.330
♪ My eyes ♪

11:59.290 --> 12:01.630
In late autumn of the fourth year
of Zhengxiang,

12:01.630 --> 12:03.960
Xiao Weiran was captured by enemy forces.

12:04.450 --> 12:05.720
You took the Moon-Shooting Bow

12:05.720 --> 12:06.720
and infiltrated the enemy camp alone

12:06.720 --> 12:07.640
to rescue him.

12:09.250 --> 12:10.660
I was in Pingling City

12:11.080 --> 12:13.240
investigating the death camp's hideouts,

12:13.240 --> 12:14.240
and at one of them,

12:14.550 --> 12:15.320
I rescued you,

12:15.320 --> 12:17.250
Weiran and Ning Fei.

12:17.960 --> 12:18.620
After that,

12:19.840 --> 12:21.580
I wiped out all the hideouts

12:22.450 --> 12:23.660
of the death camp.

12:23.860 --> 12:27.930
[Prince of Zhennan's Mansion]

12:27.610 --> 12:28.270
From now on,

12:28.790 --> 12:30.050
this will be your home.

12:34.700 --> 12:36.630
After the death camp was wiped out,

12:36.840 --> 12:38.440
you joined the Zhennan Army.

12:39.150 --> 12:40.360
We became comrades who trusted

12:40.360 --> 12:41.760
and relied on each other.

12:43.320 --> 12:45.360
In summer of the fifth year
of Zhengxiang,

12:45.360 --> 12:46.620
outside Zhennan Pass,

12:46.790 --> 12:48.850
we were ambushed by the Susha forces.

12:48.910 --> 12:51.200
The Susha forces outnumbered us
several times over,

12:51.200 --> 12:53.400
and our troops were quickly scattered.

12:54.150 --> 12:56.150
Later, the two of us got surrounded,

12:56.270 --> 12:57.750
and it was you who fought alongside me
in a bloody battle

12:57.750 --> 12:59.280
until the very last moment.

12:59.480 --> 13:00.050
Yixiao.

13:01.120 --> 13:02.180
It's because of you

13:03.000 --> 13:03.670
that I, Xia Jingshi,

13:03.670 --> 13:05.130
get to live until this day.

13:10.240 --> 13:11.910
Since I was shot off the cliff by an arrow

13:11.910 --> 13:13.570
after the Battle of Pingling,

13:13.670 --> 13:14.480
then all the twists and turns

13:14.480 --> 13:16.390
should have started from that point.

13:16.390 --> 13:17.790
Why did he leave

13:18.320 --> 13:19.920
only a few sparse notes here?

13:27.630 --> 13:28.490
Your Highness.

13:30.080 --> 13:31.870
Miss Yixiao left early this morning.

13:31.870 --> 13:32.550
She left?

13:32.570 --> 13:33.360
She said she was going to Zhengnian Hall

13:33.360 --> 13:34.360
to see Young Mistress Ling,

13:34.360 --> 13:35.820
and I didn't dare stop her.

13:37.170 --> 13:37.810
Oh, right.

13:38.150 --> 13:38.840
She also asked me to give this

13:38.840 --> 13:39.840
to Your Highness.

13:41.000 --> 13:42.200
Miss Yixiao caught this herself

13:42.200 --> 13:43.750
in the kitchen this morning.

13:43.750 --> 13:44.480
I thought it was meant

13:44.480 --> 13:45.410
for the kids,

13:45.510 --> 13:47.670
but she said it was a toy
for Your Highness.

13:47.670 --> 13:48.360
I don't know

13:48.390 --> 13:49.720
what her intention was.

13:53.480 --> 13:55.680
At least she knows to leave me a message.

13:56.840 --> 13:58.770
Now that's more like cooperation.

14:04.910 --> 14:06.020
What message?

14:06.130 --> 14:08.130
What did His Highness mean just now?

14:09.750 --> 14:10.610
Let me quiz you:

14:10.870 --> 14:13.530
in the phrase "spider's thread
and 'ma' track",

14:13.680 --> 14:15.030
what does the character "ma" refer to?

14:15.030 --> 14:16.270
Isn't it just the horse

14:16.270 --> 14:17.530
that we ride every day?

14:17.750 --> 14:18.910
No, it's the "ma" in "zao ma",
which is camel cricket.

14:18.910 --> 14:19.270
You're so...

14:19.270 --> 14:20.480
I've put the answer
right before your eyes,

14:20.480 --> 14:22.740
and you still don't know? You're just...

14:23.320 --> 14:24.870
So Miss Yixiao was using this

14:24.870 --> 14:26.730
as a secret code for His Highness?

14:27.020 --> 14:27.180
[Registry of Marriage Alliances]

14:28.720 --> 14:30.510
Our Susha Kingdom has already shown

14:30.510 --> 14:31.720
great sincerity.

14:31.790 --> 14:33.030
Shouldn't your Jinxiu Kingdom

14:33.030 --> 14:34.270
also show a bit of goodwill?

14:34.270 --> 14:35.910
The 12 counties west of the Pingling River

14:35.910 --> 14:37.970
have always been Susha's territory.

14:38.200 --> 14:39.840
It's only due to years of warfare

14:39.840 --> 14:41.620
that officials neglected their offices

14:41.620 --> 14:42.960
and merchants neglected their shops,

14:42.960 --> 14:44.790
and the common people suffered unbearably.

14:44.790 --> 14:47.560
Now that our two kingdoms
have made peace...

14:47.670 --> 14:49.150
You don't remember anything?

14:49.150 --> 14:49.790
What about everything

14:49.790 --> 14:51.250
that happened between us?

14:51.450 --> 14:52.320
Everything we've been through,

14:52.320 --> 14:53.120
even life and death...

14:53.120 --> 14:54.720
You don't remember any of it?

14:57.320 --> 14:59.080
Since this is a marriage alliance
between two kingdoms,

14:59.080 --> 15:00.300
these 12 counties

15:00.510 --> 15:01.910
should be split equally.

15:01.960 --> 15:03.120
Split equally?

15:03.760 --> 15:04.890
That's impossible.

15:05.080 --> 15:06.120
Absolutely impossible!

15:06.120 --> 15:07.550
Who would give half of the property

15:07.550 --> 15:08.550
when marrying off a daughter?

15:08.550 --> 15:10.270
We won't yield

15:10.320 --> 15:11.390
even a single inch of these 12 counties!

15:11.390 --> 15:12.910
Is this what you call

15:13.510 --> 15:14.770
sincerity from Susha?

15:15.150 --> 15:15.720
I... I...

15:17.360 --> 15:18.420
Prince of Zhennan.

15:18.550 --> 15:20.030
Please say something.

15:22.200 --> 15:24.530
Although Yixiao is in Feng Suige's hands,

15:24.630 --> 15:26.340
she's still a prisoner.

15:26.630 --> 15:28.830
Perhaps I can use that to our advantage.

15:30.200 --> 15:31.000
Alright then.

15:32.470 --> 15:32.970
Your Highness!

15:32.970 --> 15:33.840
We can't...

15:34.910 --> 15:37.080
Before coming, I already consulted with
our Emperor,

15:37.080 --> 15:39.030
and to facilitate this marriage alliance,

15:39.030 --> 15:40.000
we in Jinxiu will make

15:40.000 --> 15:41.150
the greatest concessions.

15:41.150 --> 15:42.150
Your Highness...

15:42.750 --> 15:43.810
We'll do as you say.

15:46.320 --> 15:48.410
Thank you, Prince of Zhennan.

15:48.510 --> 15:49.240
However,

15:50.490 --> 15:51.930
your Emperor

15:51.960 --> 15:54.160
also promised to return our prisoners.

15:55.550 --> 15:57.610
I'm already working on that.

15:57.790 --> 15:59.200
I'm not just talking about those captured

15:59.200 --> 16:00.480
on the battlefield.

16:00.790 --> 16:02.160
There's another prisoner.

16:02.160 --> 16:03.630
She's a female general from Jinxiu,

16:03.630 --> 16:05.030
and her name is Fu Yixiao.

16:05.360 --> 16:07.320
She's currently imprisoned in Yujing City.

16:07.320 --> 16:08.630
I hope your kingdom

16:08.910 --> 16:10.630
can return her to us soon.

16:16.790 --> 16:18.130
That's easy enough.

16:18.200 --> 16:20.630
Since His Majesty
has already issued the decree,

16:20.630 --> 16:21.790
Your Highness is merely

16:21.790 --> 16:23.550
asking for one more prisoner.

16:23.670 --> 16:24.720
I, Shen Wu,

16:24.750 --> 16:26.010
will take care of that.

16:26.910 --> 16:29.240
Thank you in advance then, Minister Shen.

16:33.030 --> 16:34.440
Your Majesty!

16:34.600 --> 16:37.630
Oh, Your Majesty!

16:38.670 --> 16:41.000
Do you really want me dead that badly?

16:41.150 --> 16:42.630
Even if I had nine heads,

16:42.630 --> 16:43.790
I wouldn't dare take people

16:43.790 --> 16:45.840
to the First Prince's mansion
and ask for that prisoner.

16:45.040 --> 16:47.110
[Registry of Marriage Alliances]

16:46.000 --> 16:47.360
Since this news got out,

16:47.480 --> 16:48.670
the Ministry of Rites already has

16:48.670 --> 16:49.870
seven officials claiming illness

16:49.870 --> 16:51.360
and three retiring to their hometowns.

16:51.360 --> 16:52.420
If this continues,

16:52.510 --> 16:55.240
there will be no one left
in the Ministry of Rites!

16:55.280 --> 16:56.350
Why don't you

16:56.420 --> 16:58.670
[Registry of Marriage Alliances]

16:57.120 --> 16:59.520
retire and return to your hometown
as well?

17:01.510 --> 17:02.310
Your Majesty,

17:03.160 --> 17:04.510
please show some mercy

17:04.510 --> 17:06.380
and issue another imperial decree.

17:06.380 --> 17:12.619
[Registry of Marriage Alliances]

17:07.130 --> 17:09.200
It was you who made promises
to Xia Jingshi,

17:09.200 --> 17:10.589
not me.

17:11.310 --> 17:13.109
So why should I issue any decree?

17:15.750 --> 17:16.780
Your Majesty.

17:16.960 --> 17:18.920
I've devoted my life
to serving our kingdom.

17:18.920 --> 17:19.980
Do you truly want to

17:20.030 --> 17:21.200
take my pathetic life?

17:21.200 --> 17:21.960
Enough!

17:22.960 --> 17:24.030
You, a high minister of a kingdom,

17:24.030 --> 17:25.760
acting like a shameless rogue.

17:26.000 --> 17:26.880
Just look at

17:26.880 --> 17:28.010
what you've become!

17:31.110 --> 17:32.680
Promises are one thing,

17:33.880 --> 17:36.140
but whether they can take the person away

17:36.240 --> 17:38.200
depends on Jinxiu's abilities.

17:43.110 --> 17:43.970
Minister Shen,

17:44.400 --> 17:45.400
you may leave now.

17:50.550 --> 17:53.160
Thank you, Your Majesty.

18:12.160 --> 18:13.000
I finally realized

18:13.000 --> 18:14.110
just now

18:14.270 --> 18:15.270
why the First Prince

18:15.270 --> 18:17.550
wants to keep that female general
by his side.

18:17.550 --> 18:18.810
Tell me your thoughts.

18:18.960 --> 18:20.550
Xia Jingshi and that female general

18:20.550 --> 18:22.240
seem to have a deep connection.

18:22.240 --> 18:22.790
The First Prince

18:22.790 --> 18:24.480
wants to use her as leverage.

18:24.550 --> 18:25.240
Leverage?

18:26.310 --> 18:27.440
That's too passive.

18:27.720 --> 18:28.920
That's not his style.

18:29.350 --> 18:32.640
He wants to pull one thread
to move the entire fabric,

18:33.720 --> 18:36.790
using this female general
to muddy the waters,

18:36.790 --> 18:38.880
and take advantage of the situation

18:39.270 --> 18:41.110
to ultimately uncover the truth behind

18:41.110 --> 18:43.310
the marriage alliance
between our kingdoms.

18:43.310 --> 18:44.270
Regarding the marriage alliance,

18:44.270 --> 18:45.880
Princess Xiyang has agreed to it,

18:45.880 --> 18:47.550
and the First Prince
hasn't objected further.

18:47.550 --> 18:48.510
Are you suggesting

18:48.510 --> 18:50.550
the First Prince still
has something up his sleeve?

18:50.550 --> 18:52.200
Whether his sister agrees or not

18:52.200 --> 18:53.060
is irrelevant.

18:53.480 --> 18:54.920
Since he doesn't approve,

18:54.920 --> 18:57.000
he would try to stop it

18:57.070 --> 18:59.130
even if it means killing Xia Jingshi.

19:00.030 --> 19:01.920
If I force him,

19:02.270 --> 19:03.480
he might even go so far

19:03.510 --> 19:06.040
as to burn down my palace
without hesitation.

19:07.350 --> 19:08.680
Daring to do anything,

19:09.400 --> 19:11.600
yet still holding onto his principles—

19:13.640 --> 19:15.310
that's my son.

19:16.550 --> 19:18.150
Your Majesty speaks wisely.

19:18.160 --> 19:19.680
The First Prince has indeed been

19:19.680 --> 19:21.010
unusually calm lately.

19:23.920 --> 19:25.480
Let's wait and see.

20:12.030 --> 20:12.680
Boss,

20:12.880 --> 20:13.740
I want this one.

20:19.880 --> 20:20.590
Stop there!

20:23.980 --> 20:25.650
[Ye's Suzhou Embroidery]

20:44.550 --> 20:45.400
Your Highness,

20:45.400 --> 20:46.160
your plan

20:46.270 --> 20:48.480
is absolutely brilliant.

20:50.680 --> 20:51.810
Did you see clearly?

20:52.000 --> 20:52.750
I did.

20:53.200 --> 20:53.750
That man is

20:53.750 --> 20:55.160
a personal guard of the Prince of Zhennan.

20:55.160 --> 20:56.000
But Yun Fang recognized him

20:56.000 --> 20:57.660
as a Jinxiu undercover guard.

20:58.160 --> 20:59.680
Your Highness, I was thinking,

20:59.680 --> 21:01.680
how could a Jinxiu undercover guard

21:01.680 --> 21:02.960
have any connection with

21:02.960 --> 21:04.560
with Prime Minister Zhuang?

21:05.390 --> 21:06.810
There's only one explanation:

21:06.810 --> 21:08.680
Xia Jingshi must be secretly colluding

21:08.680 --> 21:10.280
with Prime Minister Zhuang.

21:10.460 --> 21:11.550
Perhaps it was exactly because Miss Yixiao

21:11.550 --> 21:12.680
found out about this

21:12.680 --> 21:13.960
that she got in mortal danger.

21:13.960 --> 21:15.480
That Xia Jingshi came to Yujing

21:15.480 --> 21:16.230
specifically to

21:16.230 --> 21:17.720
take Miss Yixiao back with him.

21:17.720 --> 21:19.240
All that talk
about exchanging the captives,

21:19.240 --> 21:20.640
isn't it just an excuse to

21:20.640 --> 21:22.110
take Miss Yixiao back?

21:25.020 --> 21:26.220
I had to open my mouth.

21:26.400 --> 21:27.750
I dug too deep.

21:27.790 --> 21:28.590
Someone give me a beating.

21:28.590 --> 21:29.640
What secret could Yixiao

21:29.640 --> 21:31.440
possibly know that's worth them

21:31.750 --> 21:33.110
coming all the way to Yujing

21:33.110 --> 21:34.160
to kill her?

21:35.200 --> 21:37.330
Where's the letter they were passing?

21:39.160 --> 21:40.480
You said not to alert them,

21:40.480 --> 21:42.140
so I didn't dare intercept it.

21:42.640 --> 21:43.450
Never mind.

21:43.880 --> 21:45.530
A letter delivered by servants

21:45.530 --> 21:46.720
probably doesn't contain

21:46.720 --> 21:48.250
any valuable clues anyway.

21:48.380 --> 21:50.350
Have someone watch
the prime minister's residence closely.

21:50.350 --> 21:52.150
Report to me if there's any news.

21:52.310 --> 21:53.350
Yes, Your Highness.

21:53.350 --> 21:54.310
Well, are you going to

21:54.310 --> 21:55.920
tell Miss Yixiao about this?

21:56.350 --> 21:57.240
Tell her what?

21:57.830 --> 21:59.760
That Xia Jingshi wants to kill her?

22:00.960 --> 22:02.690
I don't have solid proof right now.

22:02.690 --> 22:03.590
Even if I told her,

22:03.590 --> 22:05.750
she'd just think
I'm trying to cause trouble.

22:05.750 --> 22:07.880
Better to let her discover it herself.

22:09.480 --> 22:11.030
She once fought by his side wholeheartedly

22:11.030 --> 22:12.160
to build his empire,

22:12.920 --> 22:15.380
but now he discards her
like worn-out shoes.

22:18.450 --> 22:20.270
If it were you, what would you do?

22:21.680 --> 22:23.010
Would you want revenge?

22:30.690 --> 22:31.550
Your Highness.

22:31.680 --> 22:32.470
If one day

22:32.490 --> 22:34.020
you want to discard me
like worn-out shoes,

22:34.020 --> 22:35.090
you wouldn't need to plot against me.

22:35.090 --> 22:36.090
Just say the word,

22:36.590 --> 22:38.520
and I'd come willingly to my death.

22:40.790 --> 22:41.390
Hey.

22:41.440 --> 22:42.880
What kind of reaction is that?

22:42.880 --> 22:45.160
I'm telling the truth, Your Highness!

22:45.510 --> 22:46.250
Really.

22:46.590 --> 22:47.160
I mean it.

22:49.960 --> 22:51.490
-Come on. Cheers.
-Cheers!

22:56.740 --> 22:57.370
Fill it up.

22:58.310 --> 22:59.270
Your shoulder is injured.

22:59.270 --> 22:59.930
Let me do it.

23:01.640 --> 23:02.160
Yixiao.

23:03.310 --> 23:04.510
You still drink from big bowls

23:04.510 --> 23:05.510
just like before.

23:06.270 --> 23:07.270
You're still you.

23:07.350 --> 23:08.610
You've never changed.

23:09.920 --> 23:11.790
Yixiao, you're lying to us, right?

23:11.790 --> 23:12.590
You've never truly

23:12.590 --> 23:13.920
forgotten us, have you?

23:19.510 --> 23:20.160
I'm sorry.

23:20.750 --> 23:22.080
I truly don't remember.

23:36.350 --> 23:36.750
Here.

23:37.270 --> 23:38.730
Let me show you something.

23:52.070 --> 23:53.930
You should remember this, right?

23:58.160 --> 23:59.750
You may forget everything else,

23:59.750 --> 24:01.750
but you can't possibly forget this.

24:02.620 --> 24:04.820
This is from the battle at Changyu Pass.

24:10.920 --> 24:11.960
This arrow was meant to pierce

24:11.960 --> 24:12.880
my chest.

24:12.960 --> 24:14.400
It was only because you saved me

24:14.400 --> 24:16.330
that it didn't hit my vital organs.

24:25.030 --> 24:26.000
Ning Fei!

24:29.790 --> 24:31.200
But this arrow was poisonous.

24:31.200 --> 24:32.270
It was also you who

24:32.680 --> 24:34.000
took a knife and carefully

24:34.000 --> 24:35.560
cut open my wound

24:39.400 --> 24:41.070
to drain the poisoned blood.

24:44.110 --> 24:45.310
If it weren't for you,

24:45.750 --> 24:47.270
I would have died long ago.

25:04.070 --> 25:04.680
Cheers!

25:19.580 --> 25:21.310
You must remember this, right?

25:31.790 --> 25:32.350
Come on.

25:33.000 --> 25:34.240
Roll up your pant leg.

25:38.000 --> 25:40.000
You have the same scar as I do.

25:41.880 --> 25:42.610
Mine's on...

25:43.240 --> 25:45.900
Mines' on the right leg,
and yours is on the left.

25:46.000 --> 25:46.720
Roll it up.

25:57.840 --> 25:59.370
They're identical.

26:00.270 --> 26:01.010
Look,

26:01.350 --> 26:03.080
our scars are exactly the same.

26:05.440 --> 26:06.790
I was shot with a cold arrow

26:06.790 --> 26:08.790
during the battle at Qianshui Pass,

26:09.030 --> 26:11.070
and you got yours protecting His Highness

26:11.070 --> 26:12.730
when a prisoner attacked you.

26:16.000 --> 26:16.970
Our wounds were

26:17.550 --> 26:18.750
about a month apart.

26:19.680 --> 26:21.480
You took care of me for two weeks,

26:21.920 --> 26:24.120
and then I took care of you for two weeks.

26:24.590 --> 26:26.120
The whole camp

26:26.550 --> 26:28.150
was laughing at us back then.

26:29.640 --> 26:30.720
Right, Weiran?

26:31.000 --> 26:32.720
Alright, that's enough. You're drunk.

26:32.720 --> 26:33.520
Stop talking.

26:39.400 --> 26:40.270
I'm not drunk.

26:42.400 --> 26:43.600
I don't believe this.

26:44.400 --> 26:45.550
Roll up your shirt

26:45.830 --> 26:46.750
and show her your back.

26:46.750 --> 26:47.720
Hey, enough.

26:51.400 --> 26:52.350
Yixiao, look.

26:52.590 --> 26:53.310
Look.

27:01.270 --> 27:02.400
You don't remember?

27:04.530 --> 27:06.500
The enemy burned our barracks,

27:07.890 --> 27:09.640
and Weiran risked his life
rushing into the flames

27:09.640 --> 27:10.390
to save us.

27:10.680 --> 27:12.340
That's how he got these burns.

27:24.400 --> 27:25.640
Enough, Ning Fei.

27:26.030 --> 27:27.230
Why tell her all this?

27:29.230 --> 27:31.290
I'm worried that if I didn't tell her,

27:31.350 --> 27:32.790
she'd forget.

27:41.070 --> 27:41.730
Yixiao.

27:41.960 --> 27:43.560
After you fell off the cliff,

27:44.830 --> 27:45.640
this guy here

27:47.240 --> 27:48.940
didn't say anything,

27:49.640 --> 27:50.840
but I know

27:51.110 --> 27:53.040
he was even more worried than I was.

27:54.480 --> 27:56.140
That's just how he is,

27:56.680 --> 27:58.880
keeping everything bottled up inside.

28:06.790 --> 28:08.350
It's a joyful day today.

28:10.070 --> 28:10.830
Let's drink!

28:13.720 --> 28:14.450
Let's drink!

28:15.160 --> 28:15.640
Come on.

28:16.480 --> 28:17.000
Cheers!

28:17.030 --> 28:18.090
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

28:29.680 --> 28:30.760
How did we

28:31.070 --> 28:32.950
fight side by side before?

28:35.200 --> 28:36.350
We Three Heroes of Jinxiu

28:36.350 --> 28:37.880
each had our own strengths.

28:38.270 --> 28:40.580
You were an exceptional archer.

28:40.750 --> 28:42.560
I was unmatched in bravery.

28:42.720 --> 28:45.790
And Weiran was a master strategist.

28:46.270 --> 28:47.200
The three of us

28:47.310 --> 28:49.510
trusted each other the most.

28:50.160 --> 28:52.200
We were sworn siblings
who'd die for each other.

28:52.200 --> 28:53.290
Sister Xueying.

28:53.480 --> 28:55.400
What are Master and Brother Ning Fei

28:55.400 --> 28:56.760
talking about?

28:56.920 --> 28:57.680
Exactly.

28:57.920 --> 28:59.920
They've been talking for six hours.

28:59.960 --> 29:00.510
Indeed.

29:01.110 --> 29:02.000
Sister Yixiao

29:02.030 --> 29:03.560
wants to uncover the truth.

29:04.030 --> 29:04.830
The person who shot her

29:04.830 --> 29:06.430
must be someone close to her.

29:07.000 --> 29:08.180
As long as she doesn't uncover the truth,

29:08.180 --> 29:09.780
she won't have peace of mind.

29:10.510 --> 29:11.530
I hope the truth

29:12.000 --> 29:13.260
won't break her heart.

29:16.720 --> 29:17.480
Ning Fei.

29:18.310 --> 29:20.240
After hearing everything you said,

29:20.240 --> 29:21.510
I never imagined we went through

29:21.510 --> 29:24.110
so many life-and-death situations
together.

29:24.480 --> 29:26.610
Since you're truly my brother in arms,

29:27.440 --> 29:28.640
please help me think—

29:28.880 --> 29:30.070
what exactly happened

29:30.070 --> 29:31.670
the day I fell off that cliff?

29:33.070 --> 29:33.830
At that time,

29:34.640 --> 29:37.750
everyone was celebrating the victory
of the Battle of Pingling,

29:37.750 --> 29:39.720
but you were nowhere to be found.

29:40.240 --> 29:41.040
The next day,

29:42.000 --> 29:43.680
a guard came and told us

29:44.400 --> 29:45.340
you fell off the cliff

29:45.340 --> 29:46.760
by accident.

29:51.560 --> 29:53.560
So I fell off the cliff by accident?

29:57.350 --> 29:58.810
Then tell me more about

29:58.920 --> 29:59.780
the Battle of Pingling—

29:59.780 --> 30:01.050
how did we fight it,

30:01.270 --> 30:02.400
and how did we win?

30:04.000 --> 30:05.330
The Battle of Pingling?

30:06.880 --> 30:07.750
At first,

30:09.460 --> 30:11.790
we planned to close
all borders and passages.

30:11.790 --> 30:12.790
His Highness said

30:13.310 --> 30:14.310
that no matter what,

30:14.310 --> 30:16.160
we must hold the city.

30:16.680 --> 30:17.550
But later,

30:18.510 --> 30:21.040
His Highness set up an ambush
inside the pass,

30:22.680 --> 30:23.880
so as long as Feng Suige

30:23.880 --> 30:25.550
broke through Zhennan Pass,

30:28.680 --> 30:30.070
he would be doomed.

30:31.630 --> 30:33.510
So according to what you're saying,

30:33.510 --> 30:35.420
when I shot an arrow at Feng Suige,

30:35.480 --> 30:36.920
I not only failed to kill him,

30:36.920 --> 30:38.250
but actually saved him?

30:40.000 --> 30:41.820
He was just lucky.

30:42.830 --> 30:43.590
Besides,

30:44.030 --> 30:44.840
you...

30:45.350 --> 30:46.570
At that time,

30:46.680 --> 30:48.040
you had no idea

30:48.400 --> 30:50.550
why His Highness would

30:50.550 --> 30:52.120
suddenly change his plan

30:52.310 --> 30:54.120
the day before Susha's attack.

30:55.270 --> 30:56.570
Change his plan?

30:58.400 --> 31:00.400
Why did he suddenly change his plan?

31:00.590 --> 31:03.150
A military report was delivered

31:03.240 --> 31:05.170
to His Highness before the battle.

31:07.640 --> 31:08.640
Isn't that right?

31:09.310 --> 31:10.370
I'm not asking you.

31:10.430 --> 31:11.990
Isn't that right, Weiran?

31:12.830 --> 31:13.750
No more drinking.

31:13.750 --> 31:14.470
Say it.

31:15.310 --> 31:16.480
What military report?

31:16.480 --> 31:18.160
Tell her, Weiran.

31:18.240 --> 31:19.500
I can't drink anymore.

31:20.480 --> 31:22.680
What military report was so important?

31:24.590 --> 31:25.510
What report?

31:26.160 --> 31:26.960
I have no idea.

31:29.480 --> 31:30.540
I'm going to sleep.

31:35.720 --> 31:36.590
Feng Suige said

31:37.110 --> 31:39.920
someone from Susha colluded with
their enemy during the Battle of Pingling.

31:39.920 --> 31:41.320
Could that intelligence

31:41.640 --> 31:43.400
have been ordered to be delivered
by that traitor

31:43.400 --> 31:44.310
from Susha?

31:55.350 --> 31:56.680
Please escort those two

31:56.680 --> 31:57.720
safely to the inn.

31:57.830 --> 31:58.240
Yes.

31:58.720 --> 31:59.270
Yixiao.

32:01.720 --> 32:02.580
Your Highness?

32:02.830 --> 32:04.160
What are you doing here?

32:04.310 --> 32:05.270
I saw that Ning Fei and Weiran

32:05.270 --> 32:06.240
still hadn't returned.

32:06.240 --> 32:08.200
I was worried, so I came to check on them.

32:08.200 --> 32:09.730
Don't worry. They're fine.

32:10.350 --> 32:11.920
They just got drunk out of happiness.

32:11.920 --> 32:13.180
They're the carriage.

32:19.160 --> 32:20.640
I've reached an agreement with Susha,

32:20.640 --> 32:22.440
and they've agreed to let you go.

32:22.460 --> 32:24.060
Ning Fei had told me about it.

32:24.310 --> 32:25.440
Then we shouldn't delay.

32:25.440 --> 32:27.040
Come with me to the inn today.

32:27.160 --> 32:29.270
I'll ask someone to
escort you back first tomorrow,

32:29.270 --> 32:31.070
and we'll meet in Pingling City.

32:31.240 --> 32:32.550
That won't be necessary.

32:32.550 --> 32:33.810
I don't plan to go back.

32:38.400 --> 32:39.800
You still don't trust me.

32:40.590 --> 32:42.110
It's not that I don't trust you.

32:42.110 --> 32:43.030
I just have some unfinished

32:43.030 --> 32:43.890
business here.

32:44.270 --> 32:45.150
Your Highness,

32:45.510 --> 32:47.440
why are you so eager to take me back?

32:47.480 --> 32:49.350
Susha is an enemy kingdom after all.

32:49.350 --> 32:49.920
Only if you return to Jinxiu

32:49.920 --> 32:51.320
can I ensure your safety.

32:51.480 --> 32:54.550
Are you sure she'll be safer there?

33:05.290 --> 33:06.890
The one who wanted to kill her

33:07.000 --> 33:08.510
is from Jinxiu,

33:13.550 --> 33:15.720
not from Susha.

33:15.970 --> 33:16.620
Yixiao.

33:16.920 --> 33:18.200
Ever since you fell off the cliff,

33:18.200 --> 33:19.270
I've had people investigating

33:19.270 --> 33:20.050
the truth behind your fall.

33:20.050 --> 33:21.550
After investigating for so long,

33:21.550 --> 33:23.440
do you have any leads now,
Prince of Zhennan?

33:23.440 --> 33:25.370
This is Jinxiu's internal affair.

33:27.070 --> 33:28.400
What does it have to do with you?

33:28.400 --> 33:30.130
She's a member of my household.

33:30.750 --> 33:31.950
Logically speaking,

33:32.000 --> 33:33.400
whoever wants to kill her

33:33.480 --> 33:35.940
should be considered my domestic business.

33:38.880 --> 33:40.740
I'm not really familiar with him.

33:42.550 --> 33:43.660
Miss Yixiao,

33:43.750 --> 33:45.410
how could you be so heartless?

33:46.030 --> 33:47.350
Have you forgotten that

33:47.350 --> 33:48.270
on that cliff,

33:48.270 --> 33:49.880
the one who could have shot you
with an arrow

33:49.880 --> 33:52.030
must be someone you deeply trusted?

33:58.850 --> 34:00.480
If His Highness wanted me dead,

34:00.480 --> 34:01.920
a single military order
would have sufficed,

34:01.920 --> 34:03.850
and I would have perished long ago.

34:04.590 --> 34:05.680
Besides, whoever wants to kill me

34:05.680 --> 34:06.840
is my own concern.

34:07.030 --> 34:08.560
It's none of your business,

34:08.760 --> 34:09.510
Your Highness First Prince.

34:09.510 --> 34:10.710
If there's nothing else,

34:10.710 --> 34:11.510
please leave.

34:12.920 --> 34:13.540
Yixiao,

34:13.670 --> 34:14.190
then...

34:14.190 --> 34:16.000
Your Highness, if there's nothing else,

34:16.000 --> 34:17.260
please return as well.

34:25.000 --> 34:26.590
You didn't actually believe

34:26.590 --> 34:28.050
she'd go with you, did you?

34:29.620 --> 34:30.670
It seems you have

34:30.670 --> 34:32.389
some grievances against me, First Prince.

34:32.389 --> 34:33.400
If I did something

34:33.400 --> 34:34.929
to upset you, First Prince,

34:35.190 --> 34:36.850
please don't take it to heart.

34:37.150 --> 34:38.949
Your wounds haven't healed yet,

34:40.070 --> 34:41.870
and anger is bad for your health.

34:42.280 --> 34:43.610
Your person wounded me,

34:44.110 --> 34:45.110
and now she has fallen

34:45.110 --> 34:46.000
into my hands.

34:46.670 --> 34:47.280
You see,

34:47.440 --> 34:48.800
it seems even heaven itself

34:48.800 --> 34:50.530
won't let me suffer injustice.

34:51.370 --> 34:52.090
By the way,

34:52.710 --> 34:54.710
First Prince,
you probably don't know it yet,

34:54.710 --> 34:56.000
but the two kingdoms
are already negotiating

34:56.000 --> 34:57.280
the specific terms
of the marriage alliance.

34:57.280 --> 34:58.230
Prime Minister Zhuang has also approved

34:58.230 --> 35:00.480
the terms for prisoner exchange
between our kingdoms.

35:00.480 --> 35:01.560
Before long,

35:01.800 --> 35:03.460
Yixiao will come back with me.

35:04.000 --> 35:04.630
Prisoner?

35:05.150 --> 35:06.410
She's not my prisoner.

35:07.030 --> 35:07.630
Who told you

35:07.630 --> 35:08.760
she was my prisoner?

35:09.230 --> 35:10.830
Have you ever seen a prisoner

35:11.190 --> 35:12.650
with such freedom as hers?

35:12.920 --> 35:14.550
Whether she's a prisoner or not,

35:14.550 --> 35:16.680
she's still Jinxiu's female general.

35:16.960 --> 35:18.480
Since she's free,

35:18.800 --> 35:20.230
then whether she stays or leaves

35:20.230 --> 35:22.190
should be her own decision.

35:22.360 --> 35:23.000
All right.

35:23.440 --> 35:24.920
Let her make her own decision.

35:24.920 --> 35:26.000
I hope you'll

35:26.590 --> 35:27.760
keep your word, First Prince.

35:27.760 --> 35:29.440
You seem very confident.

35:29.880 --> 35:31.590
You don't understand

35:34.590 --> 35:36.120
the bond between me and her.

35:36.480 --> 35:37.800
Of course I don't.

35:38.800 --> 35:40.660
How could a human ever understand

35:41.190 --> 35:44.190
why a beast would suddenly turn on them
without mercy?

35:44.590 --> 35:46.720
Yixiao will soon remember everything

35:47.110 --> 35:48.440
and come back to me.

35:48.590 --> 35:50.110
Are you truly not afraid

35:53.480 --> 35:54.800
of that day coming?

36:37.050 --> 36:38.180
Please go upstairs.

37:09.360 --> 37:10.850
Once you arrive in Jinxiu,

37:11.400 --> 37:12.710
you'll have to rely on yourself

37:12.710 --> 37:14.240
for the path ahead.

37:14.760 --> 37:16.280
But no matter what happens,

37:16.280 --> 37:17.280
always remember

37:17.840 --> 37:18.760
that you are Susha's

37:18.760 --> 37:20.090
most beloved princess.

37:20.670 --> 37:21.690
You have the right

37:21.880 --> 37:22.630
and the standing to obtain

37:22.630 --> 37:24.030
anything you desire.

37:25.510 --> 37:26.230
Mother,

37:27.170 --> 37:28.150
can I really get

37:28.150 --> 37:29.890
anything I want?

37:30.030 --> 37:30.630
Of course.

37:31.230 --> 37:32.520
You have your father,

37:32.550 --> 37:33.370
me,

37:33.670 --> 37:35.190
and the entire Susha behind you.

37:35.190 --> 37:36.110
No one can make you

37:36.110 --> 37:37.370
suffer any grievance.

37:38.440 --> 37:39.240
That's right.

37:39.590 --> 37:41.050
I'm the Princess of Susha.

37:41.400 --> 37:42.320
No matter who His Highness

37:42.320 --> 37:43.320
liked in the past,

37:44.030 --> 37:45.760
I'll be his wife from now on.

37:48.840 --> 37:50.640
The Red-Clad General of Jinxiu,

37:50.760 --> 37:51.960
so valiant and heroic,

37:51.960 --> 37:53.840
a woman matching any man's courage.

37:53.840 --> 37:56.030
Meeting you today confirms all I've heard.

37:56.030 --> 37:57.490
You flatter me, Princess.

37:57.590 --> 37:59.480
Since you arranged to meet me today,

37:59.480 --> 38:02.610
there must be some important matter
you wish to discuss.

38:05.000 --> 38:06.150
I came to see you

38:07.440 --> 38:08.510
to tell you that

38:09.480 --> 38:11.340
I know everything about your past

38:12.000 --> 38:13.530
with the Prince of Zhennan.

38:13.800 --> 38:14.550
Don't worry,

38:15.230 --> 38:16.230
I mean no harm.

38:16.880 --> 38:18.940
We're all humans with feelings.

38:19.400 --> 38:21.510
You've followed His Highness
for so many years,

38:21.510 --> 38:24.070
fighting alongside him
through life and death.

38:24.070 --> 38:24.880
You're a woman,

38:24.880 --> 38:26.510
yet you were always
by His Highness's side.

38:26.510 --> 38:28.780
It's inevitable that
he developed feelings for you.

38:28.780 --> 38:31.380
I don't care about the history
between you two.

38:31.710 --> 38:33.400
Let bygones be bygones.

38:34.660 --> 38:36.460
The future is what matters most.

38:37.190 --> 38:38.960
After I marry His Highness,

38:39.190 --> 38:40.840
I'll be by his side every day.

38:41.440 --> 38:42.360
By then,

38:43.000 --> 38:45.000
there will be no more war
between our two kingdoms,

38:45.000 --> 38:47.230
and His Highness won't need to
go to battle anymore.

38:47.230 --> 38:48.400
I'll work with him to protect

38:48.400 --> 38:50.200
the peace between our kingdoms.

38:52.710 --> 38:54.840
If you wish to stay here in our mansion,

38:55.110 --> 38:56.360
I'll treat you well.

38:57.000 --> 38:59.070
If you prefer to stay
in the military camp,

38:59.070 --> 39:00.110
I'll also certainly have His Highness

39:00.110 --> 39:00.710
arrange a suitable

39:00.710 --> 39:02.000
position for you.

39:02.710 --> 39:04.110
If you truly didn't care,

39:04.480 --> 39:06.610
you wouldn't have come to see me today.

39:06.880 --> 39:08.400
Your Highness is about to marry far
from home.

39:08.400 --> 39:09.510
You should focus more on

39:09.510 --> 39:10.440
your own future.

39:10.800 --> 39:11.600
My business

39:11.920 --> 39:13.400
is none of your concern.

39:24.280 --> 39:26.440
Since the two kingdoms
are having a marriage alliance,

39:26.440 --> 39:28.090
Father has declared a general amnesty,

39:28.090 --> 39:29.360
and the whole kingdom is celebrating.

39:29.360 --> 39:30.360
Yujing City today

39:30.400 --> 39:32.320
will surely be bustling with excitement.

39:32.320 --> 39:33.530
Miss Yixiao,

39:33.880 --> 39:35.000
why don't you join me and His Highness

39:35.000 --> 39:36.330
to see the festivities?

39:36.480 --> 39:37.610
I don't like crowds.

39:39.030 --> 39:39.890
Are you afraid?

39:45.240 --> 39:46.250
Afraid of what?

39:47.150 --> 39:49.280
Since Your Highness has kindly invited me,

39:49.280 --> 39:51.540
I shall respectfully accept your offer.

39:56.880 --> 39:59.230
Bravo! Bravo!

40:00.710 --> 40:02.920
Miss Yixiao,
you were wrong about something.

40:02.920 --> 40:03.710
It's not true that

40:03.710 --> 40:05.590
I haven't planned for my own future.

40:05.590 --> 40:06.520
On the contrary,

40:06.630 --> 40:07.400
I'm fully aware of

40:07.400 --> 40:08.630
what life awaits me

40:09.000 --> 40:10.460
after I marry into Jinxiu.

40:11.480 --> 40:12.320
Actually,

40:13.070 --> 40:13.960
the Prince of Zhennan and I

40:13.960 --> 40:15.800
have known each other for a long time.

40:15.800 --> 40:17.560
He not only saved my life,

40:17.670 --> 40:19.330
but also has affection for me.

40:19.510 --> 40:20.970
Why else would I marry him?

40:21.840 --> 40:23.700
He's Jinxiu's Prince of Zhennan,

40:24.110 --> 40:26.280
with high status
and great power in Jinxiu.

40:26.280 --> 40:27.940
And I'm the Princess of Susha,

40:28.110 --> 40:30.110
so our positions are well-matched.

40:33.190 --> 40:34.000
It seems

40:34.150 --> 40:35.230
he never told you about

40:35.230 --> 40:36.760
the past between us.

40:43.320 --> 40:45.030
Did you not hear what I said?

40:47.800 --> 40:49.800
May you two live happily ever after.

41:03.400 --> 41:04.070
Stop the carriage.

41:03.920 --> 41:06.770
[Coffin Shop]

41:23.880 --> 41:24.740
Your Highness.

41:26.400 --> 41:28.320
In public, I'll call you Young Master Xia,

41:28.320 --> 41:30.710
and you can call me Xiyang.
Is that all right?

41:30.710 --> 41:31.240
Alright,

41:31.280 --> 41:32.280
Princess Xiyang.

41:34.510 --> 41:35.110
I've heard you

41:35.110 --> 41:36.710
mention Miss Yixiao before,

41:36.880 --> 41:37.840
and I was quite curious,

41:37.840 --> 41:39.330
so I wanted to meet her.

41:39.550 --> 41:41.390
Besides, Yujing City is very lively today,

41:40.120 --> 41:43.400
[Coffin Shop]

41:41.630 --> 41:43.710
so I invited her to come sightseeing
with me.

41:43.710 --> 41:44.190
Your...

41:44.800 --> 41:46.360
Do you mind, Young Master Xia?

41:46.360 --> 41:48.220
You invited someone from my household,

41:48.220 --> 41:49.190
yet you're asking for

41:49.190 --> 41:50.280
his opinion?

41:51.480 --> 41:52.280
Brother?

41:52.880 --> 41:54.390
What brings you here?

41:54.880 --> 41:56.630
It's rare to see you
in such a leisurely mood,

41:56.630 --> 41:57.520
coming out for a stroll.

41:57.520 --> 41:59.180
I'll accompany you for a walk.

42:04.250 --> 42:05.920
Didn't you say you dislike crowds?

42:05.920 --> 42:07.170
I don't,

42:07.320 --> 42:08.070
but she does.

42:10.920 --> 42:12.550
Don't you also dislike crowds?

42:12.550 --> 42:14.010
Since we're already here,

42:14.280 --> 42:16.480
what's wrong with taking a look around?

42:19.910 --> 42:21.570
The view is better over there.

42:21.880 --> 42:22.480
Let's go.

42:32.940 --> 42:33.730
Let go.

42:33.940 --> 42:34.820
Don't forget,

42:35.190 --> 42:37.620
you're still my concubine.

42:37.710 --> 42:39.170
Don't push your luck.

42:39.840 --> 42:40.700
You did forget?

42:41.190 --> 42:42.190
How about I make a sound

42:42.190 --> 42:43.510
to remind the entire city

42:43.510 --> 42:45.370
that you, Fu Yixiao, belong to me?

42:45.970 --> 42:48.310
I want Xia Jingshi to see

42:48.510 --> 42:49.910
that his beloved general

42:50.030 --> 42:51.110
is now mine.

42:54.030 --> 42:54.670
Xiyang!

42:55.110 --> 42:55.760
Come on!

42:56.070 --> 42:56.760
Coming.

43:00.590 --> 43:01.110
Let's go.
